# Aaruthra Studio — frontend environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` inside frontend/ and adjust if needed.
# `.env` is git-ignored; only this example file is committed.

# Base URL of the Django REST API.
# Leave as "/api" for local dev — Vite's dev server proxies /api to
# http://127.0.0.1:8000 (see vite.config.ts), and in production you'd
# serve the built frontend behind the same domain/reverse proxy as the
# Django backend. Set an absolute URL if the API is on a different origin,
# e.g. https://api.aaruthrastudio.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api